  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Rowan Desktop Retest L4, the afternoon is interrupted by clattering hooves, surprised yelps, and frantic bleating. Close by, a fluffy white sheep with a black face and curled horns bounds toward you and the group.\n\nAn ornate scroll is held in the sheep’s mouth. As it approaches, the sheep waves the scroll toward you, its motion drawing the eye as clearly as the commotion around it.\n\nThe sheep is here before you, scroll still in its mouth and waving toward the group. You can address the sheep, take a closer look at the scroll, or respond to the commotion in whatever way you choose.",
      "event_id": 388,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "source": "wild_sheep_chase_chapter_source_fidelity_demonstration",
          "audience": "player",
          "page_end": 1,
