    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "As you read the scroll aloud, the sheep’s bleating changes. The sounds resolve into cultured Common, touched with an elven accent and a faint bleat at the edges.\n\n“I am Finethir Shinebright,” he says urgently. “I’m a wizard, and I need your aid. A dangerous wizard has taken a powerful artifact—I must recover it.” The ornate scroll remains in his mouth as he speaks, its waving now less frantic.\n\nThe commotion of hooves and bleating continues around you. What do you say or do?",
      "event_id": 391,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "source": "wild_sheep_chase_chapter_source_fidelity_demonstration",
          "audience": "player",
          "page_end": 1,
