    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Finethir, who changed you into a sheep, what artifact was taken, and how can I help you recover it?",
      "event_id": 394,
      "citations": [],
      "rules_edition": null,
      "ruling_citation_ids": [],
      "turn_id": null,
      "roll_status": null,
      "roll": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:10:48.008260Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Finethir’s cultured voice, still edged with a faint bleat, grows more urgent. “Ahmed Noke—my former apprentice—did this to me. He took my Wand of True Polymorph. I need access to it to return to my proper form, and I’m asking you to help me recover it.”\n\nThe sheep keeps the ornate scroll in its mouth as the commotion of hooves and bleating carries on around you. Finethir has named the wizard and the wand, but hasn’t yet said where Ahmed or the artifact can be found. What do you ask or do next?",
      "event_id": 394,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "source": "wild_sheep_chase_chapter_source_fidelity_demonstration",
          "audience": "player",
          "page_end": 1,
