    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Where can I find Ahmed Noke and the wand, and what dangers should I expect there?",
      "event_id": 397,
      "citations": [],
      "rules_edition": null,
      "ruling_citation_ids": [],
      "turn_id": null,
      "roll_status": null,
      "roll": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:11:33.009878Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Finethir answers from behind the ornate scroll, his cultured voice still touched by a faint bleat. “Ahmed keeps my former home a few miles southeast of town. Follow the well-trodden path through the sparse woodland, and you’ll reach his place.”\n\nHis curled horns shift as he adds, “He keeps the wand on his person and rarely leaves unless absolutely necessary. The compound is occupied, and his transformed followers guard it—wolves and other beasts. That’s what I know of the dangers; I can’t promise what you’ll meet along the way.”\n\nThe sheep remains before you amid the continuing clatter and bleating, the scroll still in its mouth. What do you do next?",
      "event_id": 397,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "source": "wild_sheep_chase_chapter_source_fidelity_demonstration",
