    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You step between Finethir and the approaching noise, drawing your longsword as the pursuit pushes into view. Howling, angry shouts, and occasional screams swell around the clatter of the crowd. A hulking half-orc comes through with one hand on a greatsword. Three large wolves in iron collars keep close, while the heavy footfalls of a huge cloaked figure sound behind them.\n\nThe half-orc fixes his small eyes on the sheep. “That sheep is Master Noke’s... he desires to have it back.” Finethir stays behind you, the ornate scroll still in his mouth. The half-orc and his companions have not yet reached you.",
      "event_id": 400,
      "citations": [
